IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sv71-nouns`
IMPORT `sv71-cross-references`

-- Row il-71. TESTS THAT PIN THE READINGS of the two items: the issue dates the footers print, what each instruction names and does, the words each printed text holds, the commencements as the pages print them, both limbs, and how each limb was read.
-- These pass: they say what was read from what. The assertions that the references are NOT complete are in sv71-tests-red.l4.
-- The expected values are written from NOTES.md (the answer tables and the quotation lines), not copied from the values in sv71-cross-references.l4.

§ `Tests of the readings`

-- The issue dates the footers print. An issue date is NOT a commencement date.
#ASSERT `SH 404`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 16 8 1963
#ASSERT `SH 856`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 25 3 1977
#ASSERT `SH 1919`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 18 1 2004
#ASSERT `SH 2024`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 10 8 2005
#ASSERT `SH 2190`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 16 11 2008
#ASSERT `SH 2338`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 27 2 2012
#ASSERT `SH 2442`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 19 3 2014
#ASSERT `SH 2459`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 15 7 2014
#ASSERT `SH 2632`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 5 4 2017
#ASSERT `SH 3363`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 30 1 2025

-- The order of the instruments the two items rest on.
#ASSERT `the first instrument was issued after the second` `SH 2338` `SH 2190`
#ASSERT `the first instrument was issued after the second` `SH 2632` `SH 2338`
#ASSERT `the first instrument was issued after the second` `SH 2024` `SH 856`
#ASSERT `the first instrument was issued after the second` `SH 856` `SH 404`
#ASSERT NOT (`the first instrument was issued after the second` `SH 2190` `SH 2632`)

-- I1: what SH 2338 does, and where.
#ASSERT `SH 2338 section 1 inserts paragraph (4) of 11(gimel)`'s `the kind` EQUALS Insert
#ASSERT `SH 2338 section 1 inserts paragraph (4) of 11(gimel)`'s `it comes after the paragraph` EQUALS JUST 3
#ASSERT `SH 2338 section 1 inserts paragraph (4) of 11(gimel)`'s `the place it names` EQUALS `paragraph 11(gimel)(4)`
#ASSERT `SH 2338 section 1 inserts paragraph (4) of 11(gimel)`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 177
#ASSERT `paragraph (4) as printed in SH 2338`'s `the place it is printed at` EQUALS `paragraph 11(gimel)(4)`

-- I1: what SH 2190 and SH 2632 do to paragraph (2) and paragraph (3), and what neither names.
#ASSERT `SH 2190 section 1 replaces subsection 11(gimel)`'s `the kind` EQUALS Replace
#ASSERT `SH 2190 section 1 replaces subsection 11(gimel)`'s `the place it names` EQUALS `subsection 11(gimel)`
#ASSERT `SH 2632 section 90(1) replaces paragraph (2) of 11(gimel)`'s `the kind` EQUALS Replace
#ASSERT `SH 2632 section 90(1) replaces paragraph (2) of 11(gimel)`'s `the place it names` EQUALS `paragraph 11(gimel)(2)`
#ASSERT `SH 2632 section 90(2) deletes paragraph (3) of 11(gimel)`'s `the kind` EQUALS Delete
#ASSERT `SH 2632 section 90(2) deletes paragraph (3) of 11(gimel)`'s `the place it names` EQUALS `paragraph 11(gimel)(3)`
#ASSERT NOT (`some instruction in the list names the place` `paragraph 11(gimel)(4)` `the instructions on section 11 issued after SH 2338`)

-- I1: the words of paragraph (2) as each instrument printed it. The 2008 words contain the term; the 2017 words do not, and they name the Civil Service Law of 2017.
#ASSERT `the printed text contains the words` `paragraph (2) as printed in SH 2190` "הגדרה"
#ASSERT NOT (`the printed text contains the words` `paragraph (2) as printed in SH 2632` "ילד")
#ASSERT `the printed text contains the words` `paragraph (2) as printed in SH 2632` "חוק שירות אזרחי"
#ASSERT `paragraph (2) as printed in SH 2190`'s `the place it is printed at` EQUALS `paragraph 11(gimel)(2)`
#ASSERT `paragraph (2) as printed in SH 2632`'s `the place it is printed at` EQUALS `paragraph 11(gimel)(2)`
#ASSERT (`the pointer in paragraph (4) to paragraph (2)`'s `the named paragraph as the last instrument deposited here left it`)'s `the instrument that printed it` EQUALS `SH 2632`
#ASSERT `the pointer in paragraph (4) to paragraph (2)`'s `the paragraph the pointer names` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the pointer in paragraph (4) to paragraph (2)`'s `the term the pointer's words put in marks` EQUALS "ילד"

-- I1: the commencement of section 90 of SH 2632, as the page prints it, is not the issue date; SH 2338 prints none.
#ASSERT `the commencement of SH 2632 section 90`'s `the date the page prints` EQUALS JUST (Date 1 4 2018)
#ASSERT NOT (`the commencement of SH 2632 section 90`'s `the date the page prints` EQUALS JUST (`SH 2632`'s `its issue date`))
#ASSERT `the commencement of SH 2632 section 90`'s `how it was read` EQUALS `official page image`
#ASSERT `the commencement of SH 2338 section 1`'s `the date the page prints` EQUALS NOTHING

-- I1: which later instructions have an image deposited.
#ASSERT `SH 2632 section 90(1) replaces paragraph (2) of 11(gimel)`'s `a page image of it is deposited`
#ASSERT `SH 3363 section 9 inserts subsection 11(vav)`'s `a page image of it is deposited`
#ASSERT NOT (`SH 2442 section 24 inserts paragraph (5) of 11(gimel)`'s `a page image of it is deposited`)

-- I2: where the phrase P was written, by which instrument, on which page.
#ASSERT `section 21 as printed in SH 404`'s `the place it is printed at` EQUALS `section 21`
#ASSERT `section 21 as printed in SH 404`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 138
#ASSERT `subsection (he) as printed in SH 856`'s `the place it is printed at` EQUALS `subsection 11(he)`
#ASSERT `subsection (he) as printed in SH 856`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 153
#ASSERT elem `section 21 as printed in SH 404` `the places where an instrument deposited here wrote the phrase P into the Law`
#ASSERT elem `subsection (he) as printed in SH 856` `the places where an instrument deposited here wrote the phrase P into the Law`
#ASSERT `SH 856 section 1 inserts subsection 11(he)`'s `it comes after the subsection` EQUALS JUST Dalet

-- I2: the instruction of SH 2024 section 67, as printed.
#ASSERT `SH 2024 section 67 replaces the phrase P in section 21`'s `the place it names` EQUALS `section 21`
#ASSERT `SH 2024 section 67 replaces the phrase P in section 21`'s `the kind` EQUALS `Replace words`
#ASSERT `SH 2024 section 67 replaces the phrase P in section 21`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 913
#ASSERT `SH 2024 section 67 replaces the phrase P in section 21`'s `the words it puts` EQUALS LIST "כהגדרתה בחוק הפיקוח על שירותים פיננסיים (קופות גמל), התשס״ה–2005"

-- I2: the commencement of SH 2024 as the page prints it is a number of days, not a date. The calendar date below is COMPUTED from the issue date, not printed.
#ASSERT `the commencement of SH 2024 section 67`'s `the date the page prints` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the commencement of SH 2024 section 67`'s `the number of days after publication the page prints` EQUALS JUST 90
#ASSERT `the issue date plus the days, computed` (Date 10 8 2005) 90 EQUALS Date 8 11 2005
#ASSERT `the commencement date computed from the days the page prints` `the commencement of SH 2024 section 67` EQUALS JUST (Date 8 11 2005)
#ASSERT `the commencement date computed from the days the page prints` `the commencement of SH 2632 section 90` EQUALS NOTHING

-- I2: what the later instruments on subsection (ה) name. The words SH 1919 names occur in the 1977 print and not inside the phrase P; SH 2459 names no section and none of the pairs on its deposited band occurs inside P; SH 3363 names subsection (ו).
#ASSERT `SH 1919 section 18 replaces the opening of subsection 11(he)`'s `the words it names` EQUALS LIST "שהגיע ל־65"
#ASSERT `SH 1919 section 18 deletes words of subsection 11(he)`'s `the words it names` EQUALS LIST "לעובדת או"
#ASSERT `the printed text contains the words` `subsection (he) as printed in SH 856` "לעובדת או"
#ASSERT `the printed text contains the words` `subsection (he) as printed in SH 856` "המעביד"
#ASSERT `no words the instruction names occur inside the phrase` `the phrase P` `SH 1919 section 18 replaces the opening of subsection 11(he)`
#ASSERT `no words the instruction names occur inside the phrase` `the phrase P` `SH 1919 section 18 deletes words of subsection 11(he)`
#ASSERT `no words the general replacement names occur inside the phrase` `the phrase P` `SH 2459 replaces words in the laws of its Schedule`
#ASSERT NOT (`SH 2459 replaces words in the laws of its Schedule`'s `it names a section of the Law`)
#ASSERT `SH 2459 replaces words in the laws of its Schedule`'s `the Schedule item that names the Law` EQUALS 14
#ASSERT `SH 2459 replaces words in the laws of its Schedule`'s `the word the Schedule item excepts` EQUALS "מעבידים"
#ASSERT `SH 2459 replaces words in the laws of its Schedule`'s `the section the exception is in` EQUALS 32
#ASSERT `SH 2459 replaces words in the laws of its Schedule`'s `the printed page of the instruction` EQUALS 600
#ASSERT `SH 2459 replaces words in the laws of its Schedule`'s `the printed page of the Schedule` EQUALS 603
#ASSERT `SH 2459 pair (4)`'s `the words replaced` EQUALS "המעביד"
#ASSERT `SH 2459 pair (4)`'s `the words put in` EQUALS "המעסיק"
#ASSERT NOT (`some instruction in the list names the place` `subsection 11(he)` (LIST `SH 3363 section 9 inserts subsection 11(vav)`))
#ASSERT `some instruction in the list names the place` `subsection 11(vav)` (LIST `SH 3363 section 9 inserts subsection 11(vav)`)

-- I2: what SH 2024 prints about the Income Tax Ordinance, and what it does not print. The words of the deleted paragraph are not on any page deposited.
#ASSERT `SH 2024 section 61 item (9) on the Income Tax Ordinance`'s `the kind` EQUALS Delete
#ASSERT `SH 2024 section 61 item (9) on the Income Tax Ordinance`'s `the words it names` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT NOT (`SH 2024 section 61 item (9) on the Income Tax Ordinance`'s `the page prints the words it removes`)
#ASSERT `SH 2024 section 61 item (9) on the Income Tax Ordinance`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 912
#ASSERT `SH 2024 section 61 item (13)(a) on the Income Tax Ordinance`'s `the words it names` EQUALS LIST "כמשמעותה בסעיף 47"
#ASSERT `SH 2024 section 61 item (13)(a) on the Income Tax Ordinance`'s `the page prints the words it removes`
#ASSERT `what paragraph (2) of section 47 subsection Alef of the Income Tax Ordinance said before SH 2024 deleted it` EQUALS `not checked`

-- I2: SH 2024 section 84 replaces words of the same kind in the Retirement Age Law; its replaced words are not the phrase P letter for letter.
#ASSERT `SH 2024 section 84 on the Retirement Age Law`'s `the words it names` EQUALS LIST "כמשמעותה בסעיף 47 בפקודת מס הכנסה"
#ASSERT NOT (`SH 2024 section 84 on the Retirement Age Law`'s `the words it names` EQUALS LIST `the phrase P`)
#ASSERT `SH 2024 section 84 on the Retirement Age Law`'s `the kind` EQUALS `Replace words`

-- Both limbs hold for the two items, and how each limb was read.
#ASSERT `both limbs hold` `item I1: paragraph (4) of 11(gimel) points at a definition referred to in paragraph (2)`
#ASSERT `both limbs hold` `item I2: subsection 11(he) says the phrase P, which the 2005 law replaced in section 21 of the same Law`
#ASSERT `item I1: paragraph (4) of 11(gimel) points at a definition referred to in paragraph (2)`'s `limb (a) was read` EQUALS `official page image`
#ASSERT `item I1: paragraph (4) of 11(gimel) points at a definition referred to in paragraph (2)`'s `limb (b) was read` EQUALS `official page image, with the later instruments listed in NOTES.md`
#ASSERT `item I2: subsection 11(he) says the phrase P, which the 2005 law replaced in section 21 of the same Law`'s `limb (a) was read` EQUALS `official page image`
#ASSERT `item I2: subsection 11(he) says the phrase P, which the 2005 law replaced in section 21 of the same Law`'s `limb (b) was read` EQUALS `official page image, with the later instruments listed in NOTES.md`
